{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55626","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十四 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危岭如登百尺楼，千般异景望中收。\n浮生但向忙时过，万事须从静处休。\n道直岂教容鬼怪，理平唯只使魔愁。\n空门莫说无知己，满目松萝是我俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}